---
import PolicySection from "./PolicySection.astro";
import { ul } from "./styles";
---

<PolicySection title="Who can see your data">
  <ul class:list={ul}>
    <li>
      The other members of your group see your e-mail address, the tasks you create and join, the days or weeks you mark
      done, your streaks and your place on the leaderboard.
    </li>
    <li>Anyone signed in who has your group's invite link can see the group's name before joining.</li>
    <li>
      When you leave a group, or its owner removes you, your participation and the days or weeks you marked done in its
      tasks are deleted and the group no longer shows your e-mail address. Tasks you created stay in the group.
    </li>
    <li>Nobody else sees your e-mail address in the app.</li>
  </ul>
</PolicySection>
